      "note": [
        "Internal personnel refers to persons employed by enterprises that perform R&D. External contributors (e.g. consultants) to R&D are not included. ",
        "From reference year 2023 a new method to ensure confidentiality has been implemented. This means that no values are suppressed. This change can affect the comparability with previous years on a detailed level.",
        "Correction 2025-09-11: Full-time equivalents in NACE 45-47+55-56 concerning reference year 2023 have been corrected."
